      "name": "Oscar Utomo",
      "created_at": "2023-09-29T10:24:42.049Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Based on <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/35857\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">POS CLOSING ENTRY: Can refer row only if the charge type is 'On Previous Row Amount' or 'Previous Row Total' · Issue #35857 · frappe/erpnext · GitHub</a> , seems there is an error if i’m using sales charges and tax templates with  ‘On Previous Row Amount’ or ‘Previous Row Total’ in the Charge Types.</p>\n<p>Is there anyone here can help how to solve this bug?</p>",
