      "id": 483195,
      "username": "oscarutomo",
      "name": "Oscar Utomo",
      "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:37:04.522Z",
      "cooked": "<p>forgot having this post, i found solution about this issue. hopefully this would be helpful in the future for anybody who need this.</p>\n<p>So i modified my file<br>\n<code>erpnext/accounts/doctype/pos_invoice_merge_log.py</code></p>\n<p>I change line 258, from :</p>\n<p><code>tax.charge_type = \"Actual\"</code></p>\n<p>to</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/6/1642fab9aaf316a90486effd47c45c35b6bd173a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1642fab9aaf316a90486effd47c45c35b6bd173a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/6/1642fab9aaf316a90486effd47c45c35b6bd173a.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3aW0r4ytVu9LRav1qncmHe11wvM\" width=\"690\" height=\"349\" data-dominant-color=\"262626\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">862×436 28.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>anw, i’m using erp14 and 15. same bug same solution</p>",
